  "description": "The edge deployment is based on schema version\u202f1.1 and runs on Docker with a minimum Docker version of **v1.25**. Logging is configured with the option \u201c--log-level=info\u201d. Access to the private container registry is provided via credentials for **myregistry** (username\u202f*user1*, password\u202f*pass1*, address\u202f*myregistry.azurecr.io*).\n\nSystem modules include **edgeAgent** (Docker) using the image **mcr.microsoft.com/azureiotedge-agent:1.4**, with an environment variable **SAMPLE_VAR** set to \u201cvalue1\u201d and an image\u2011pull policy of **on-create**. The **edgeHub** (Docker) runs the image **mcr.microsoft.com/azureiotedge-hub:1.4**, has an environment variable **HUB_LOG_LEVEL** set to \u201cinfo\u201d, is marked as **running**, uses a restart policy of **always**, pulls images **on-create**, and starts with order\u202f0.  \n\nTwo custom modules are defined. The **temperatureSensor** module (Docker, version\u202f1.0) is **running**, restarts on failure, pulls images **on-create**, and starts with order\u202f1. It uses the image **myregistry.azurecr.io/tempsensor:1.0** together with the create\u2011options payload `{\"HostConfig\": {\"NetworkMode\": \"host\"}}`. Its environment includes **SENSOR_INTERVAL** set to\u202f10. The **humiditySensor** module (Docker, version\u202f1.0) is **stopped**, never restarts, pulls images **never**, and starts with order\u202f2. It runs the image **myregistry.azurecr.io/humidity:1.0** and defines an environment variable **HUMIDITY_THRESHOLD** set to\u202f70.",
  "reference_json": {
    "$edgeAgent": {
      "properties.desired": {
        "schemaVersion": "1.1",
        "runtime": {
          "type": "docker",
          "settings": {
            "minDockerVersion": "v1.25",
            "loggingOptions": "--log-level=info",
            "registryCredentials": {
              "myregistry": {
                "username": "user1",
                "password": "pass1",
                "address": "myregistry.azurecr.io"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "systemModules": {
          "edgeAgent": {
            "type": "docker",
            "settings": {
              "image": "mcr.microsoft.com/azureiotedge-agent:1.4"
            },
            "env": {
              "SAMPLE_VAR": {
                "value": "value1"
              }
            },
            "imagePullPolicy": "on-create"
          },
          "edgeHub": {
            "type": "docker",
            "settings": {
              "image": "mcr.microsoft.com/azureiotedge-hub:1.4"
            },
            "env": {
              "HUB_LOG_LEVEL": {
                "value": "info"
              }
            },
            "status": "running",
            "restartPolicy": "always",
            "imagePullPolicy": "on-create",
            "startupOrder": 0
          }
        },
        "modules": {
          "temperatureSensor": {
            "type": "docker",
            "version": "1.0",
            "status": "running",
            "restartPolicy": "on-failure",
            "settings": {
              "image": "myregistry.azurecr.io/tempsensor:1.0",
              "createOptions": "{\"HostConfig\": {\"NetworkMode\": \"host\"}}"
            },
            "env": {
              "SENSOR_INTERVAL": {
                "value": 10
              }
            },
            "imagePullPolicy": "on-create",
            "startupOrder": 1
          },
          "humiditySensor": {
            "type": "docker",
            "version": "1.0",
            "status": "stopped",
            "restartPolicy": "never",
            "settings": {
              "image": "myregistry.azurecr.io/humidity:1.0"
            },
            "env": {
              "HUMIDITY_THRESHOLD": {
                "value": 70
              }
            },
            "imagePullPolicy": "never",
            "startupOrder": 2
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}